gral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b46520e2-8393-5de1-be06-50725802fa84\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b46520e2-8393-5de1-be06-50725802fa84\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"b46520e2-8393-5de1-be06-50725802fa84\" :question/answer-fields \"b03e80bb-34d2-5dc0-8f11-c8f0c17dc1e1\"] [:db/ensure \"b46520e2-8393-5de1-be06-50725802fa84\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"b46520e2-8393-5de1-be06-50725802fa84\"] [:db/add \"cbdddafa-9be7-5e98-973b-dd4f3bb7695d\" :answer/id #uuid \"cbdddafa-9be7-5e98-973b-dd4f3bb7695d\"] [:db/add \"cbdddafa-9be7-5e98-973b-dd4f3bb7695d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cbdddafa-9be7-5e98-973b-dd4f3bb7695d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"cbdddafa-9be7-5e98-973b-dd4f3bb7695d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ff80e381-e130-5fd9-a95c-788f8e47a8a8\" :answer/id #uuid \"ff80e381-e130-5fd9-a95c-788f8e47a8a8\"] [:db/add \"ff80e381-e130-5fd9-a95c-788f8e47a8a8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ff80e381-e130-5fd9-a95c-788f8e47a8a8\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ff80e381-e130-5fd9-a95c-788f8e47a8a8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e3711022-6630-5d01-8274-e51b51b64d42\" :answer/id #uuid \"e3711022-6630-5d01-8274-e51b51b64d42\"] [:db/add \"e3711022-6630-5d01-8274-e51b51b64d42\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e3711022-6630-5d01-8274-e51b51b64d42\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{16}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e3711022-6630-5d01-8274-e51b51b64d42\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"72281e4d-d8e3-5aa3-806e-897099cb473b\" :answer/id #uuid \"72281e4d-d8e3-5aa3-806e-897099cb473b\"] [:db/add \"72281e4d-d8e3-5aa3-806e-897099cb473b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"72281e4d-d8e3-5aa3-806e-897099cb473b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{12}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"72281e4d-d8e3-5aa3-806e-897099cb473b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\" :answer/id #uuid \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\"] [:db/add \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/choices \"cbdddafa-9be7-5e98-973b-dd4f3bb7695d\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/choices \"ff80e381-e130-5fd9-a95c-788f8e47a8a8\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/choices \"e3711022-6630-5d01-8274-e51b51b64d42\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/choices \"72281e4d-d8e3-5aa3-806e-897099cb473b\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/choices \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\"] [:db/add \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/correct \"6e7cfa1e-0fcf-5c6f-a38b-58c8d91d433e\"] [:db/ensure \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\" :question/id #uuid \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\"] [:db/add \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\" :question/answer-fields \"553a2ded-32b2-5bc1-94c6-af80b3f751a7\"] [:db/ensure \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"80642ecb-a7bf-5ecf-b181-2c9d86eed532\"] [:db/add \"efcb16f0-b034-54f8-be60-cacfde229ea4\" :answer/id #uuid \"efcb16f0-b034-54f8-be60-cacfde229ea4\"] [:db/add \"efcb16f0-b034-54f8-be60-cacfde229ea4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"efcb16f0-b034-54f8-be60-cacfde229ea4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"efcb16f0-b034-54f8-be60-cacfde229ea4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"43a3c627-8420-553e-9775-8297c5519256\" :answer/id #uuid \"43a3c627-8420-553e-9775-8297c5519256\"] [:db/add \"43a3c627-8420-553e-9775-8297c5519256\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"43a3c627-8420-553e-9775-8297c5519256\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"43a3c627-8420-553e-9775-8297c5519256\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d41339c2-4319-5ac1-9edb-43963bb0bf1e\" :answer/id #uuid \"d41339c2-4319-5ac1-9edb-43963bb0bf1e\"] [:db/add \"d41339c2-4319-5ac1-9edb-43963bb0bf1e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d41339c2-4319-5ac1-9edb-43963bb0bf1e\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d41339c2-4319-5ac1-9edb-43963bb0bf1e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"88ae7e44-6ec9-5993-840d-775267630964\" :answer/id #uuid \"88ae7e44-6ec9-5993-840d-775267630964\"] [:db/add \"88ae7e44-6ec9-5993-840d-775267630964\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"88ae7e44-6ec9-5993-840d-775267630964\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"88ae7e44-6ec9-5993-840d-775267630964\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\" :answer/id #uuid \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\"] [:db/add \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/choices \"efcb16f0-b034-54f8-be60-cacfde229ea4\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/choices \"43a3c627-8420-553e-9775-8297c5519256\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/choices \"d41339c2-4319-5ac1-9edb-43963bb0bf1e\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/choices \"88ae7e44-6ec9-5993-840d-775267630964\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/choices \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\"] [:db/add \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/correct \"c937b68c-882d-5db6-9845-e4f007fc9953\"] [:db/ensure \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\" :question/id #uuid \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\"] [:db/add \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{1}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\" :question/answer-fields \"81dd724e-4227-52d4-815e-348f1b11afee\"] [:db/ensure \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"56d6cead-d259-5303-87fb-5e2111fe05f3\"] [:db/add \"2fa9a6cf-4858-559e-916a-a1315f3dfe2b\" :answer/id #uuid \"2fa9a6cf-4858-559e-916a-a1315f3dfe2b\"] [:db/add \"2fa9a6cf-4858-559e-916a-a1315f3dfe2b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2fa9a6cf-4858-559e-916a-a1315f3dfe2b\" :answer/value \"\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2fa9a6cf-4858-559e-916a-a1315f3dfe2b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6cded9ad-cc23-5579-9aa3-f736deb6117d\" :answer/id #uuid \"6cded9ad-cc23-5579-9aa3-f736deb6117d\"] [:db/add \"6cded9ad-cc23-5579-9aa3-f736deb6117d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6cded9ad-cc23-5579-9aa3-f736deb6117d\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"6cded9ad-cc23-5579-9aa3-f736deb6117d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\" :answer/id #uuid \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\"] [:db/add \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0f3b0e8a-c465-5427-be23-1a85f3f636f8\" :answer/id #uuid \"0f3b0e8a-c465-5427-be23-1a85f3f636f8\"] [:db/add \"0f3b0e8a-c465-5427-be23-1a85f3f636f8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0f3b0e8a-c465-5427-be23-1a85f3f636f8\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"0f3b0e8a-c465-5427-be23-1a85f3f636f8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4be62f24-c88a-59b7-b3bc-4d6b50594e21\" :answer/id #uuid \"4be62f24-c88a-59b7-b3bc-4d6b50594e21\"] [:db/add \"4be62f24-c88a-59b7-b3bc-4d6b50594e21\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4be62f24-c88a-59b7-b3bc-4d6b50594e21\" :answer/value \"\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 x}{3} \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"4be62f24-c88a-59b7-b3bc-4d6b50594e21\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/choices \"2fa9a6cf-4858-559e-916a-a1315f3dfe2b\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/choices \"6cded9ad-cc23-5579-9aa3-f736deb6117d\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/choices \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/choices \"0f3b0e8a-c465-5427-be23-1a85f3f636f8\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/choices \"4be62f24-c88a-59b7-b3bc-4d6b50594e21\"] [:db/add \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/correct \"315e4ff4-ec1d-56c7-aa23-df35250ec972\"] [:db/ensure \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\" :question/id #uuid \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\"] [:db/add \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\cdot 3=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\" :question/answer-fields \"14e877b1-eed4-58e5-a9a6-60c0c3a37664\"] [:db/ensure \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"96100969-066d-5014-b021-b96b25f2b3b9\"] [:db/add \"857d92c7-90cb-55bf-8622-19f8dadfc3bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"857d92c7-90cb-55bf-8622-19f8dadfc3bb\"] [:db/add \"857d92c7-90cb-55bf-8622-19f8dadfc3bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"857d92c7-90cb-55bf-8622-19f8dadfc3bb\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"857d92c7-90cb-55bf-8622-19f8dadfc3bb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"77100392-83c2-53b8-8787-ea965743c68d\" :answer/id #uuid \"77100392-83c2-53b8-8787-ea965743c68d\"] [:db/add \"77100392-83c2-53b8-8787-ea965743c68d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"77100392-83c2-53b8-8787-ea965743c68d\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"77100392-83c2-53b8-8787-ea965743c68d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\" :answer/id #uuid \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\"] [:db/add \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"55163330-bfe7-5529-9d4c-9debf1865250\" :answer/id #uuid \"55163330-bfe7-5529-9d4c-9debf1865250\"] [:db/add \"55163330-bfe7-5529-9d4c-9debf1865250\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"55163330-bfe7-5529-9d4c-9debf1865250\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"55163330-bfe7-5529-9d4c-9debf1865250\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"88f73057-8300-5eed-8fce-c10dbefff77a\" :answer/id #uuid \"88f73057-8300-5eed-8fce-c10dbefff77a\"] [:db/add \"88f73057-8300-5eed-8fce-c10dbefff77a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"88f73057-8300-5eed-8fce-c10dbefff77a\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"88f73057-8300-5eed-8fce-c10dbefff77a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/choices \"857d92c7-90cb-55bf-8622-19f8dadfc3bb\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/choices \"77100392-83c2-53b8-8787-ea965743c68d\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/choices \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/choices \"55163330-bfe7-5529-9d4c-9debf1865250\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/choices \"88f73057-8300-5eed-8fce-c10dbefff77a\"] [:db/add \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/correct \"da279c9f-69d6-5715-8bee-e28e55f1c47a\"] [:db/ensure \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\" :question/id #uuid \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\"] [:db/add \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\cdot 3=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\" :question/answer-fields \"aec901a7-c5f6-5de8-a811-82f353c28823\"] [:db/ensure \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"ef6e80f4-b442-5ef9-b012-ef27f6c6b282\"] [:db/add \"356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42\" :answer/id #uuid \"356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42\"] [:db/add \"356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\" :answer/id #uuid \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\"] [:db/add \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6\" :answer/id #uuid \"137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6\"] [:db/add \"137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096\" :answer/id #uuid \"acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096\"] [:db/add \"acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096\" :answer/value \"\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7a88937d-98b1-5a0a-a2ca-19e05052aaaf\" :answer/id #uuid \"7a88937d-98b1-5a0a-a2ca-19e05052aaaf\"] [:db/add \"7a88937d-98b1-5a0a-a2ca-19e05052aaaf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7a88937d-98b1-5a0a-a2ca-19e05052aaaf\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7a88937d-98b1-5a0a-a2ca-19e05052aaaf\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/choices \"356aa473-84e1-5535-aaa2-aa2681447f42\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/choices \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/choices \"137bef25-0c9d-53eb-b93f-8dadcf9ad2e6\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/choices \"acddae16-70ca-5fa3-ac17-19f9dfc59096\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/choices \"7a88937d-98b1-5a0a-a2ca-19e05052aaaf\"] [:db/add \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/correct \"7b2b68e8-b944-599c-b112-ffad3b49ee2e\"] [:db/ensure \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\" :question/id #uuid \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\"] [:db/add \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot 2=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\" :question/answer-fields \"7b3269e1-45a2-5b31-8ff8-ffe29be72b8f\"] [:db/ensure \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"a1b9c34c-5506-51fe-8360-e85d7783f504\"] [:db/add \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\" :answer/id #uuid \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\"] [:db/add \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4\" :answer/id #uuid \"5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4\"] [:db/add \"5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7da8c8c1-b742-5ca6-a3f5-5c1edb13d182\" :answer/id #uuid \"7da8c8c1-b742-5ca6-a3f5-5c1edb13d182\"] [:db/add \"7da8c8c1-b742-5ca6-a3f5-5c1edb13d182\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7da8c8c1-b742-5ca6-a3f5-5c1edb13d182\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7da8c8c1-b742-5ca6-a3f5-5c1edb13d182\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b67a993a-4802-51da-8691-bb651164582d\" :answer/id #uuid \"b67a993a-4802-51da-8691-bb651164582d\"] [:db/add \"b67a993a-4802-51da-8691-bb651164582d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b67a993a-4802-51da-8691-bb651164582d\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b67a993a-4802-51da-8691-bb651164582d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bb3ec334-e96d-5437-8f99-389021fd2c33\" :answer/id #uuid \"bb3ec334-e96d-5437-8f99-389021fd2c33\"] [:db/add \"bb3ec334-e96d-5437-8f99-389021fd2c33\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bb3ec334-e96d-5437-8f99-389021fd2c33\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bb3ec334-e96d-5437-8f99-389021fd2c33\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/choices \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/choices \"5b3f02eb-d44e-552b-8e56-5bfcf92c87e4\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/choices \"7da8c8c1-b742-5ca6-a3f5-5c1edb13d182\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/choices \"b67a993a-4802-51da-8691-bb651164582d\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/choices \"bb3ec334-e96d-5437-8f99-389021fd2c33\"] [:db/add \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/correct \"07f2c3b5-a666-58aa-801f-8f96561d27b1\"] [:db/ensure \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\" :question/id #uuid \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\"] [:db/add \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cdot 2=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\" :question/answer-fields \"bc859b12-ce5c-59f6-a573-b923ea5e7fb1\"] [:db/ensure \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"e4c8e167-221b-5005-acc4-46a539f68550\"] [:db/add \"829f43d8-7cbe-57fe-bc49-f1315b3eb66b\" :answer/id #uuid \"829f43d8-7cbe-57fe-bc49-f1315b3eb66b\"] [:db/add \"829f43d8-7cbe-57fe-bc49-f1315b3eb66b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"829f43d8-7cbe-57fe-bc49-f1315b3eb66b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"829f43d8-7cbe-57fe-bc49-f1315b3eb66b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0d50adb3-edc2-5e17-9435-bc631c8b2465\" :answer/id #uuid \"0d50adb3-edc2-5e17-9435-bc631c8b2465\"] [:db/add \"0d50adb3-edc2-5e17-9435-